---
import Band from '../components/Band.astro'
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="How to reach a person, file a veto, or raise a concern.">
	<Band>
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">Reach a person</h1>

		<div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6">
				<h2 class="font-bold">File a veto</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
					Email a filing to either monitored address below within the challenge window. It's
					published exactly as received.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">veto@radix.community</p>
				<p class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">rac@radix.community</p>
			</div>

			<div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6">
				<h2 class="font-bold">Raise a concern</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
					To request a Community Accountability Hearing or raise a dispute, use the same
					monitored addresses. Read the process before you file.
				</p>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/Shadaffy/radix-dao-governance/blob/master/pending/governance/dispute-resolution-and-arbitration-policy.md"
					class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline"
					>How disputes are resolved <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span></a
				>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-[var(--color-border)] p-6 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
			A discussion platform hasn't been designated yet, so there's nowhere to send you for
			open-ended conversation about a proposal in progress. That's a known gap — check back once
			the DAO names one.
		</div>
	</Band>
</BaseLayout>
